{"results":[{"url":"https://twitter.com/greenhousemd","final_url":"https://x.com/greenhousemd","title":"Deborah Greenhouse (@greenhousemd) on X","description":"pediatrician, mom, loves hiking, gardening, and advocating for kids everywhere. \nTweets are my own, not medical advice. she/her","language":"en","text":"Thank you, Senator @TIDEVINE .\n@AnnieAndrewsMD is the right choice for South Carolina right now.\nShe has the education. She has the priorities. She has the ability to work across the aisle.\nLet's make this happen, South Carolina. Get out there and vote!\n\nProud to stand with my Sister Senator @SenatorShealy as we stand in support of @AnnieAndrewsMD for US Senate.\nWe need to put people or partisanship and prioritize South Carolinians over Washington. We can do this!!!!","author":"Deborah Greenhouse","published_date":null,"latency_ms":1963.9678800003821,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}